        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-BDS650, Extra Long 6.5\" Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA Doorware Exclusive, the 6-1/2 Inch Modern Door Stop is made from solid brass for durability. It is easy to install,  just screw onto the baseboard casement or door bottom. The Extra Long 6.5 inch Door Stop has a beautiful, contemporary appearance that will look great in almost any setting. It comes packaged with both gray and white rubber tips and installation screw.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-BDS650-specifications.gif?v=1704354660\" width\"581\" height=\"207\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Modern Baseboard Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD-BDS650 Contemporary Baseboard Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/rubber-replacement-tip-for-contemporary-door-stop-deltana-bds450-repl-tip\"><b>Rubber Bumper Tips</b></a>: White and Gray Tips included</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-BDS650-specifications.pdf?v=1704262317\" target=\"new\"><b>DWD-BDS650 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
