                "description": "DWD-BDS650, 6-1/2 Inch Modern Door Stop - A Doorware Exclusive, the 6-1/2 Inch Modern Door Stop is made from solid brass for durability. It is easy to install,  just screw onto the baseboard casement or door bottom. The Extra Long 6.5 inch Door Stop has a beautiful, contemporary appearance that will look great in almost setting. It comes packaged with both gray and white rubber tips and installation screw.\r\n",
